<view class="page address-page">
  <view class="address-heading"><text class="eyebrow">SEND A LITTLE WARMTH</text><text class="serif title">暖意，送到你身边。</text><text class="muted small">{{selectMode ? '选择本单地址，配送范围会在结算时校验。' : '好好保存每一个等待美味的地方。'}}</text></view>
  <view class="notice address-notice">外卖仅限浙江省杭州市西湖区、拱墅区、上城区。邮寄暂不支持港澳台、新疆、西藏，其他地区按演示规则校验。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!addresses.length}}" class="empty"><image src="/assets/icons/address.png" mode="aspectFit" class="empty-address"/><text class="serif">还没有保存的地址</text><text class="small muted">添加一处地址，让小美好顺利抵达。</text></view>
  <view wx:for="{{addresses}}" wx:key="id" class="address-card {{selectedId === item.id ? 'address-selected' : ''}}"><view class="address-main" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose"><view class="row between"><view class="contact-line"><text class="contact-name">{{item.contact}}</text><text class="phone">{{item.phone}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{item.isDefault}}" class="badge">默认</text></view><text class="address-region">{{item.province}} {{item.city}} {{item.district}}</text><text class="address-detail">{{item.detail}}</text><view class="row between"><text class="service-zone">{{item.deliveryAvailable ? '位于演示外卖配送区域' : '超出演示外卖区域，可校验邮寄'}}</text><text wx:if="{{selectMode}}" class="choose-address">{{selectedId === item.id ? '当前选择' : '选择此地址 →'}}</text></view></view><view class="address-tools"><button class="default-button {{item.isDefault ? 'is-default' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="makeDefault"><view class="radio-circle"><view wx:if="{{item.isDefault}}"/></view>{{item.isDefault ? '默认地址' : '设为默认'}}</button><view><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">编辑</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy}}">删除</button></view></view></view>
  <button class="btn add-button" bindtap="add"><text class="add-symbol">+</text>新增收货地址</button>
  <text class="address-footnote">省、市、区请填写完整名称，例如「浙江省 / 杭州市 / 西湖区」。</text>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{editing}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="close" catchtouchmove="noop"><view class="sheet address-sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="sheet-head"><view><text class="eyebrow">ADDRESS BOOK</text><text class="serif sheet-title">{{form.id ? '编辑这处地址' : '新增一处小期待'}}</text></view><button class="close-button" bindtap="close" disabled="{{busy}}"><image src="/assets/icons/close.png" mode="aspectFit"/></button></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="address-form" show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="form-pair"><view class="field"><text class="label">联系人 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="请输入姓名" value="{{form.contact}}" maxlength="20" data-field="contact" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">手机号码 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="11 位手机号码" value="{{form.phone}}" type="number" maxlength="11" data-field="phone" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">省份 / 自治区 / 直辖市 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：浙江省" value="{{form.province}}" maxlength="20" data-field="province" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="form-pair"><view class="field"><text class="label">城市 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：杭州市" value="{{form.city}}" maxlength="20" data-field="city" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">区县 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：西湖区" value="{{form.district}}" maxlength="20" data-field="district" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">详细地址 *</text><textarea class="input detail-input" placeholder="街道、楼栋与门牌号" value="{{form.detail}}" maxlength="100" data-field="detail" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="default-switch"><view><text>设为默认地址</text><text class="small muted">下次下单，少一点填写。</text></view><switch checked="{{form.isDefault}}" color="#60371F" bindchange="setDefaultSwitch"/></view><view class="small muted field-hint">地址仅保存在本机，用于课程演示，无真实配送服务。</view></scroll-view><button class="btn save-address" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存这处地址</button></view></view>
